# A homed printer changes to T1 (pickup only, since no tool is known
# mounted), then back to T0 (dropoff of T1, then pickup of T0). Both changes
# run the change hook templates, the dock motion templates and
# ACTIVATE_EXTRUDER, T1's heater target starts a temperature wait, and T1's
# gcode offset lands in the gcode origin and is removed again for T0.
CONFIG printer.cfg
DICTIONARY linuxprocess.dict

G28
M104 T1 S60
T1
GET_POSITION
HOTENDCHANGER_STATUS
T0
GET_POSITION
HOTENDCHANGER_STATUS
M400
